# Interfaces & code budgets

## Conditioning vector (Phase-1 live pack = **5** numbers)
Logged / trained layout (`CONDITIONING_LAYOUT`):
| Field | Dim | Meaning |
|---|---|---|
| `p_hat_x/y(t+Δ)` | 2 | Predicted object XY at action-landing time |
| `v_hat_x/y` | 2 | Object XY velocity (post-step FD in sim) |
| `delta` | 1 | Lookahead actually used (must be packed — G1 hole if omitted) |

Dropped as CONSTANT in oracle demos until G2: `p_hat_z`, `v_hat_z`, `sigma_*`, `valid`, `coast_time`.

Train still samples Δ ∈ [0, 0.4] s from oracle state, but the net **sees** which Δ built p̂. Eval sets Δ = measured latency (0.25 s until measured). Full plan schema (~12) may return when filter uncertainty / coast are live. Oracle and filter **must** emit the same pack. Swapping them is a config flag, not a rewrite.

Do not ship a 4-number pack and call G1 a hypothesis test.

## Budgets (glue, not frameworks)
| Module | Budget |
|---|---|
| Detector glue | ~50 |
| Tracker | ~100 |
| 3D lift | ~80 |
| Kalman filter | ~200 |
| Policy state append | ~50 |
| Executor buffer | ~150 |
